# armour/shared/pauldron_roll3_l: the medium ROLL pauldron on the left shoulder (roll.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# two stuffed sausage rolls of quilted cloth, the pinch between them notching the outline (HOMESPUN, padded).
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the lower roll's foot, G the quilting tack, N the pinch, P the upper roll.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-SHOULDERS gen.py from shapes.py (re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
